"Similar to any artist in the current playlist (as reported by EchoNest)"
msgstr "مشابه با هر هنرمندی در فهرست پخش فعلی (طبق گزارش EchoNest)"

#: dynamic/biases/EchoNestBias.cpp:142
#, kde-format
